{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1092", "sample_idx": 27, "model_name": "meta/llama-4-maverick-17b-128e-instruct", "content": "My recent trip to Japan was a truly unforgettable experience. From the moment I arrived in Tokyo, I was struck by the city's vibrant energy and unique blend of traditional and modern culture. I spent my days exploring the city's many neighborhoods, from the neon-lit streets of Shinjuku to the serene gardens of the Imperial Palace.\n\nOne of the highlights of my trip was visiting the famous Tsukiji Outer Market, where I sampled some of the freshest sushi I've ever had. I was also amazed by the city's cutting-edge technology, from the robots and artificial intelligence on display at the Miraikan museum to the high-speed trains that whisked me away to Kyoto.\n\nIn Kyoto, I was struck by the city's stunning temples and gardens, particularly the iconic Fushimi Inari shrine with its thousands of vermilion torii gates. I also enjoyed a traditional tea ceremony, which provided a peaceful respite from the hustle and bustle of city life.\n\nThroughout my trip, I was impressed by the Japanese people's hospitality and respect for tradition. From the polite bow of a shopkeeper to the intricate rituals of a traditional tea ceremony, I was constantly reminded of the country's rich cultural heritage. My trip to Japan was a truly enriching experience that left me with many fond memories and a deep appreciation for this fascinating country.", "logprobs": [{"token": "My", "logprob": -0.40969008207321167}, {"token": " recent", "logprob": -0.003243544837459922}, {"token": " trip", "logprob": -6.9141146923357155e-06}, {"token": " to", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " Japan", "logprob": -3.576278118089249e-07}, {"token": " was", "logprob": -6.556489552167477e-06}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.20399616658687592}, {"token": " truly", "logprob": -0.6840745806694031}, {"token": " unforgettable", "logprob": -0.0003486264031380415}, {"token": " experience", "logprob": -